## Fix: Configure SSL Client Certificate for API Gateway Stage

To remediate this violation, add a client certificate to your API Gateway stage:

```typescript
import * as aws from "@pulumi/aws";

// First, create a client certificate
const clientCert = new aws.apigateway.ClientCertificate("apiClientCert", {
    description: "Client certificate for API Gateway stage",
});

// Then reference it in your stage configuration
const stage = new aws.apigateway.Stage("myApiStage", {
    restApi: myRestApi.id,
    deployment: myDeployment.id,
    stageName: "production",
    clientCertificateId: clientCert.id, // Add this property to enable SSL client authentication
});
```

