## Fix: Configure CloudWatch Log Group Retention Period

To comply with PCI DSS 10.5.1 audit log retention requirements, set a retention period of at least 365 days on your CloudWatch log group.

```typescript
import * as aws from "@pulumi/aws";

const logGroup = new aws.cloudwatch.LogGroup("example-log-group", {
    name: "/aws/lambda/my-function",
    retentionInDays: 365, // Set retention to at least 365 days for PCI DSS compliance
});
```

Valid retention values (in days): 1, 3, 5, 7, 14, 30, 60, 90, 120, 150, 180, 365, 400, 545, 731, 1096, 1827, 2192, 2557, 2922, 3288, 3653, or 0 (never expire).

